===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*steh₂-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|столъ}}, {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*stolъ}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|stool}}. {{doublet|ru|стул}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
